      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise attending clinicians like Dr. Tsung and Dr. Turner for their clinical skill and caring approach toward anxious animals. Support staff including receptionists Rosie and Marisol receive positive mentions for patience. However, several reviewers complain about curt phone interactions and limited Spanish-language assistance."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for reactive animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight the gentle handling and patience displayed by clinic staff when examining companion animals. Clients with reactive, nervous, or elderly pets appreciate technicians who use calm restraint techniques during physical exams, helping pets remain settled and secure throughout appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frustration with itemized service estimates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pricing transparency is a frequent topic of debate among clinic clients. While some visitors find routine care fees manageable, multiple reviewers express shock at costly estimates for routine procedures like feline neutering and dental cleanings, citing separate charges for blood work, anesthesia, and medication that escalate the final bill."
      }
    }
  ],
